    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Retail Revenge \u2014 where &quot;The customer is always right&quot; ends at the door.</strong><br>Take on the role of a retail store worker trying to survive the daily chaos. Manage the shop, scan items, stock shelves \u2014 or lose your mind and fight back when customers push too far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You choose how the story plays out:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay calm and run the store like a pro.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap under pressure and pick up a weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix retail management with brutal stress relief!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re scanning groceries, fighting off angry mobs, or just trying to survive another shift, every day in <i>Retail Revenge</i> is unpredictable.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Retail Revenge \u2014 where &quot;The customer is always right&quot; ends at the door.</strong><br>Take on the role of a retail store worker trying to survive the daily chaos. Manage the shop, scan items, stock shelves \u2014 or lose your mind and fight back when customers push too far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You choose how the story plays out:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay calm and run the store like a pro.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap under pressure and pick up a weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix retail management with brutal stress relief!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re scanning groceries, fighting off angry mobs, or just trying to survive another shift, every day in <i>Retail Revenge</i> is unpredictable.</p>",
    "short_description": "Work in retail? Ever wanted to deal with that annoying customer your own way? Now you can. Retail Revenge is a VR store simulator where you choose: stay professional \u2014 or fight back.",
